      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِفَارَةٌ</span></b>  (A, Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُفَارَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَفَارَةٌ</span> (Msb,
